[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15900.229, "timestamp": "04:25:00", "text": "Y肯定需要等等，所以是谁？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15902.469, "timestamp": "04:25:02", "text": "阿比盖尔？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15905.189, "timestamp": "04:25:05", "text": "这就是立场。还有，铃木，你在哪儿？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15907.83, "timestamp": "04:25:07", "text": "铃木在那边？铃木，你在哪儿？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15910.389, "timestamp": "04:25:10", "text": "你下次得到的帮助会更少。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15912.71, "timestamp": "04:25:12", "text": "在一氧化二氮中？你是一朵花。你的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15914.95, "timestamp": "04:25:14", "text": "花。是的，当你复活后，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15917.83, "timestamp": "04:25:17", "text": "达到你的极限。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15920.469, "timestamp": "04:25:20", "text": "好了。你的摊位就在那里。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15921.91, "timestamp": "04:25:21", "text": "她被困已经有一段时间了。你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15925.51, "timestamp": "04:25:25", "text": "我一直没用过她。我没有。我曾"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15927.83, "timestamp": "04:25:27", "text": "查看地图。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15929.59, "timestamp": "04:25:29", "text": "她就像个自动装置一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15931.59, "timestamp": "04:25:31", "text": "攻击下面的那个家伙。我不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15934.389, "timestamp": "04:25:34", "text": "当然。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15937.99, "timestamp": "04:25:37", "text": "我不知道。我迷路了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15939.51, "timestamp": "04:25:39", "text": "如果你做不到，那我们就一起做一个吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15942.95, "timestamp": "04:25:42", "text": "船。对，造条船。昂贵的。这"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15946.79, "timestamp": "04:25:46", "text": "你他妈什么意思？弄条船。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15948.79, "timestamp": "04:25:48", "text": "只是五号木杆而已。没关系。我们将"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15950.229, "timestamp": "04:25:50", "text": "美好的。你没有科学仪器。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15953.03, "timestamp": "04:25:53", "text": "我负责组建智囊团。哦，我有一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15955.11, "timestamp": "04:25:55", "text": "科学机器。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15957.03, "timestamp": "04:25:57", "text": "祝你组建智库一切顺利。和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15958.87, "timestamp": "04:25:58", "text": "然后是一堆木板。我们为何如此"}]